{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026rsXLUTTZzf1795787065.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>AEON信貸財務(亞洲)指，系統上周三被黑客入侵，暫無證據顯示資料被不當使用。</p><p></p><p>AEON就事件致歉，指已通知可能受影響客戶，及調整信用卡「無卡支付」，交易限額至0元，以免被騙徒利用信用卡轉帳。會免費補發全新卡號的信用卡，不會影響信用額、結欠及獎賞積分等。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.AEON-1700.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026tJmn69Pj1j1795787075.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>又譴責違法入侵行為，已通報個人資料私隱專員公署及警方，並委聘獨立第三方網絡安全及數碼鑑證專家，協助調查事件及評估其潛在影響。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T14:04:03.023131+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":190,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T09:31:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T01:57:14.998368+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T13:57:25.768069+00:00","content_hash":"ff9a62e8d5a0a3c302bac2f3522a81931abc7065f0dd4cf2b711a4d15f45ba4a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T14:04:03.023131+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}